    "detailed_description": "Important: This game requires at least 2 players.<br />\r\nYou can play online by using Remote play together.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAsymmetrical competitive action game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe intruder player aims for the goal at the right end of the screen in each stage.<br />\r\nPoints are awarded in the order in which they reach the goal.<br />\r\nThe player with the most points at the end of a given stage wins.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOne of the players turns to the enemy side to interfere with clearing the stage.<br />\r\nOne of the players takes turns to be the tracker for each stage. The player sets traps &amp; manipulates enemy ninjas to prevent them from interfering with the player.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe number of traps in a stage changes depending on the difficulty level.<br />\r\nThe number of traps is 30. The number of traps changes for each stage.<br />\r\nYou can enjoy different combinations each time!",
    "about_the_game": "Important: This game requires at least 2 players.<br />\r\nYou can play online by using Remote play together.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAsymmetrical competitive action game.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe intruder player aims for the goal at the right end of the screen in each stage.<br />\r\nPoints are awarded in the order in which they reach the goal.<br />\r\nThe player with the most points at the end of a given stage wins.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOne of the players turns to the enemy side to interfere with clearing the stage.<br />\r\nOne of the players takes turns to be the tracker for each stage. The player sets traps &amp; manipulates enemy ninjas to prevent them from interfering with the player.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe number of traps in a stage changes depending on the difficulty level.<br />\r\nThe number of traps is 30. The number of traps changes for each stage.<br />\r\nYou can enjoy different combinations each time!",
    "short_description": "Asymmetrical versus action game. The game is divided into two sides: the intruder side and the pursuer side. The intruder player aims for the goal at the right end of the screen in each stage. The pursuer player sets traps &amp; controls enemy ninjas to prevent players from interfering.",
